        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SB3058, Small Shutter Door Latch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Small Window Shutter Door Bar Latch is normally used to lock 2 shutter doors together in the closed position. It is also useful to lock other small doors used on furniture or closets. This Small window shutter latch is easy to install and is made from quality solid brass material for a long lasting life.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SB3058-Specifications.gif?v=1704354561\" width=\"468\" height=\"163\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SB3058 Small Shutter Door Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-large-window-shutter-door-lock-deltana-sb3178\"><b>Larger Shutter Door Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SB3058 Small Shutter Door Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lock Bar Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Locking Gap: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Pivot Plate Height: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Pivot Plate Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SB3058.pdf?v=1691095375\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SB3058 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
